WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:05.200
Let's get into a mostly upright position, take your thumbs here, and place them under this

2
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:05.700
frequency,

3
00:00:05.940 --> 00:00:08.120
and put it under your armpits like this.

4
00:00:08.760 --> 00:00:11.520
You're going to take a deep breath in through your nose,

5
00:00:11.900 --> 00:00:16.020
adopt a slightly straighter posture for the body because we are going to work with the central channel.

6
00:00:16.280 --> 00:00:18.000
Inhale through the nose,

7
00:00:19.740 --> 00:00:25.260
and exhale through the mouth the notion of self, your mental toxins, selfishness.

8
00:00:25.480 --> 00:00:27.300
You're releasing them from within, so inhale.

9
00:00:37.652 --> 00:00:40.372
Exhale out the unnecessary.

10
00:00:40.692 --> 00:00:41.612
Inhale.

11
00:00:58.425 --> 00:01:00.105
One last time, inhale.

12
00:01:14.285 --> 00:01:19.305
To have clear awareness, now place your longest finger at the level of the nasion.

13
00:01:19.305 --> 00:01:21.185
Plug the right nostril.

14
00:01:21.485 --> 00:01:22.125
You will

15
00:01:24.218 --> 00:01:25.838
inhale through the left nostril.

16
00:01:26.258 --> 00:01:28.538
And think of inhaling prana.

17
00:01:29.258 --> 00:01:31.118
So focus on this level of prana.

18
00:01:31.258 --> 00:01:32.838
Inhale through the left nostril.

19
00:01:44.198 --> 00:01:48.018
Plug the other side and exhale through the right nostril.

20
00:01:53.310 --> 00:01:55.250
You re-inhale through the right nostril.

21
00:02:03.410 --> 00:02:05.770
You shift and exhale through the left nostril.

22
00:02:17.330 --> 00:02:18.510
You repeat the cycle.

23
00:02:18.830 --> 00:02:20.070
Inhale prana.

24
00:02:20.363 --> 00:02:26.823
The air, the light, the vibration, through the left nostril, all

25
00:02:26.823 --> 00:02:27.283
gently.

26
00:02:34.363 --> 00:02:36.723
Exhale through the right nostril.

27
00:02:43.523 --> 00:02:46.183
Re-inhale one more time through the right nostril.

28
00:02:51.756 --> 00:02:53.456
Exhale through the left nostril.

29
00:03:00.436 --> 00:03:02.176
Do it one last time.

30
00:03:03.056 --> 00:03:05.376
Gently inhale through the left nostril.

31
00:03:13.816 --> 00:03:15.536
Exhale through the right nostril.

32
00:03:22.008 --> 00:03:23.448
Little by little if you do this

33
00:03:24.628 --> 00:03:25.368
from time to time,

34
00:03:25.368 --> 00:03:27.268
you will open two small channels here

35
00:03:27.788 --> 00:03:29.808
which will open the sinus space

36
00:03:29.808 --> 00:03:32.068
and will enhance clarity of thought.

37
00:03:33.208 --> 00:03:34.788
We must open the central channel.

38
00:03:35.448 --> 00:03:37.328
To do this, we will use

39
00:03:37.328 --> 00:03:39.468
the pressure of prana.

40
00:03:39.468 --> 00:03:40.448
We will do a mula bandha.

41
00:03:40.448 --> 00:03:42.228
This means we will contract the perineum.

42
00:03:42.648 --> 00:03:44.008
First, we will inhale.

43
00:03:44.008 --> 00:03:44.508
We will do a mula bandha.

44
00:03:45.661 --> 00:03:49.021
We inflate here, then I contract the perineum,

45
00:03:49.201 --> 00:03:53.241
pull in the belly and lift the diaphragm to elevate the air bowl upward,

46
00:03:53.801 --> 00:03:56.201
I tuck in my chin, close the glottis,

47
00:03:56.501 --> 00:04:01.761
and gradually bring a sensation as if I am applying this pressure to open here.

48
00:04:02.201 --> 00:04:07.301
We inhale, bringing the pranic air bowl into the belly,

49
00:04:08.861 --> 00:04:12.361
you pull in, do a slight pelvic tilt, close the glottis,

50
00:04:12.654 --> 00:04:17.474
You tilt and lift the diaphragm to the top.

51
00:04:20.474 --> 00:04:21.714
And you release.

52
00:04:24.934 --> 00:04:29.154
There, you open your central channel in the form of a symbol.

53
00:04:29.734 --> 00:04:30.974
Inhale once more.

54
00:04:53.726 --> 00:04:55.646
The last time, I inhale.

55
00:05:10.719 --> 00:05:18.499
Now, you empty the air completely, as much as you can, and

56
00:05:18.499 --> 00:05:23.819
in the end, through the emptiness, you lift your diaphragm, like

57
00:05:23.819 --> 00:05:26.039
this, and then you lower it, let me show you.

58
00:05:43.652 --> 00:05:45.132
This will warm up the body a bit

59
00:05:46.192 --> 00:05:48.112
and at the same time, you will open things up a bit.

60
00:05:49.092 --> 00:05:50.212
You will just take your hands

61
00:05:50.212 --> 00:05:52.632
and you will open and stretch a bit

62
00:05:52.632 --> 00:05:53.892
all the meridians

63
00:05:54.792 --> 00:05:56.992
to have your hands well open

64
00:05:56.992 --> 00:05:58.432
and your body ready to work.

65
00:06:00.092 --> 00:06:01.052
Like this.

66
00:06:07.324 --> 00:06:09.664
We bring chi into the hands.

67
00:06:16.484 --> 00:06:19.224
There you go, place yourself in a meditative state you can.

68
00:06:19.624 --> 00:06:21.904
And close your eyes.

69
00:06:22.644 --> 00:06:24.464
And become aware of prana.

70
00:06:25.804 --> 00:06:29.024
Prana like a means, like a vehicle.

71
00:06:30.024 --> 00:06:32.124
Remember that prana is air.

72
00:06:33.697 --> 00:06:38.757
It is this light and this energy in

73
00:06:38.757 --> 00:06:39.797
the form of vibration.

74
00:06:40.617 --> 00:06:42.697
Somewhere, you are nourished by prana.

75
00:06:44.497 --> 00:06:49.737
If you become aware of this quality, you

76
00:06:49.737 --> 00:06:53.137
will become aware of what we call the whole.

77
00:06:54.097 --> 00:06:59.537
If you are aware of your breathing in this three-dimensionality,

78
00:06:59.817 --> 00:07:01.017
you become...

79
00:07:01.090 --> 00:07:06.410
the whole. It’s so simple that we often don't do it. In a way,

80
00:07:06.410 --> 00:07:07.090
we can say

81
00:07:07.090 --> 00:07:12.390
that healing is the healing of disease, it’s an awareness. At some point, you won’t

82
00:07:12.390 --> 00:07:16.090
talk about disease anymore, but about a low vibration. So if you know how to

83
00:07:16.090 --> 00:07:20.350
raise your vibration, if you know how to raise this frequency, you

84
00:07:20.350 --> 00:07:25.470
will achieve healing. This is for

85
00:07:29.162 --> 00:07:34.282
as a therapist, you always have to raise your vibration or neutralize it.

86
00:07:34.282 --> 00:07:34.822
You must rise to become untouchable.

87
00:07:36.022 --> 00:07:40.602
One should not particularly perceive this detail, otherwise, one falls into pride.

88
00:07:42.582 --> 00:07:46.362
In the end, you must also give everything back, all of it.

89
00:07:47.022 --> 00:07:50.282
This is where we must be in a state of non-wanting.

90
00:07:52.062 --> 00:07:54.042
In a way,

91
00:07:55.242 --> 00:07:56.462
Whether we are aware or not, we pass through prana.

92
00:07:57.235 --> 00:08:01.395
Be in the time of non-judgment.

93
00:08:02.675 --> 00:08:04.455
And now the patient will ask you to place them at the level that suits them best.

94
00:08:05.055 --> 00:08:10.175
This can be visceral, cranial, spinal, anything.

95
00:08:10.175 --> 00:08:10.615
You just need to be attentive and follow the present movement.

96
00:08:11.575 --> 00:08:16.475
In a way, the only thing that exists is harmony.

97
00:08:17.255 --> 00:08:20.715
And harmony is achieved through the complementarity of duality in the continuation

98
00:08:21.475 --> 00:08:24.775
of the equality of the other.

99
00:08:25.308 --> 00:08:30.328
Often, it is pride to give an answer before the question.

100
00:08:30.328 --> 00:08:35.128
Often, without realizing it, we create reference points, we create questions for the patient.

101
00:08:36.568 --> 00:08:41.788
Free yourself from this.

102
00:08:42.668 --> 00:08:43.428
A person does not create their disease, they endure it.

103
00:08:44.328 --> 00:08:46.448
It is a response to the question they have asked, more or less consciously.

104
00:08:47.608 --> 00:08:52.488
Breathe not by your will, the will to help the other which

105
00:08:52.488 --> 00:08:55.340
can ultimately cause more harm than good.

106
00:08:56.020 --> 00:08:59.960
Breathe in prana, raise your vibration.

107
00:09:00.540 --> 00:09:06.880
One way to raise your vibration is to become aware that

108
00:09:06.880 --> 00:09:09.140
each word is a vibration.

109
00:09:10.420 --> 00:09:15.380
Eliminate from your vocabulary as much as possible the words that have a low frequency.

110
00:09:16.173 --> 00:09:21.693
You will cleanse your inner diamond. This is where you need to become conscious. Each

111
00:09:21.693 --> 00:09:21.873
word,

112
00:09:22.033 --> 00:09:28.853
each gesture, each glance is a vibration. Raise your vibration. It’s as if the

113
00:09:28.853 --> 00:09:29.333
earth needs it. Be like weavers of light. Each

114
00:09:29.333 --> 00:09:34.913
time you have a thought,

115
00:09:35.333 --> 00:09:41.993
it goes into the akasha and it is woven into the great web. We

116
00:09:41.993 --> 00:09:42.793
have the right to this consciousness.

117
00:09:43.606 --> 00:09:48.826
There, you can feel a vibration in your heart, like little

118
00:09:48.826 --> 00:09:49.646
sparkles.